# ─── Signing keys & secrets — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────
# android.keystore signs the SOLARA APK. Publishing it would let anyone
# ship a build Android accepts as a legitimate update to this app.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
android.keystore
key.properties
keystore.properties
secrets.properties
local.properties
.env
.env.*

# The SOLARA draw operator keypair. It signs close_round/tally_batch/
# draw_winners on mainnet. It lives on the VPS at /root/solara-cron/ and
# must never end up in this repo.
operator*.json

# ─── Build outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig
*.ap_
*.dex
build/
.gradle/
manifest-checksum.txt

# ─── Bubblewrap / TWA scaffolding ─────────────────────────────────────
# This repo publishes the web app to GitHub Pages. The Android wrapper
# lives in ~/solana-lotto-android/, so none of the leftover TWA build
# files below belong in the deployed site.
app/
gradle/
gradlew
gradlew.bat
build.gradle
settings.gradle
gradle.properties
twa-manifest.json
store_icon.png

# ─── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: /vendor is deliberately NOT ignored — solana-web3.iife.min.js and
# buffer.min.js are vendored on purpose so the site has no CDN dependency.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
bower_components/

# ─── Tooling & editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────
.aider*
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*~

# ─── OS junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Local scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_vendortest.html
*.log
*.bak
*.orig
# Dated screenshots dropped into the repo root by macOS/Android capture
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9] *.jpg
